     "max": 139,
     "perLine": 34.8,
     "lines": 4,
     "caps": false,
     "sz": 16,
     "paras": 1,
     "text": "Gumbaz — binoning yopilmasi; u ichki makonni kengaytiradi va uzoqdan ko'zga tashlanadi. Temuriylar davrida qo'sh gumbazlar keng qo'llangan.",
     "font": "Georgia",
     "anchor": "t",
     "box": [
      6705600,
      2717800,
      4064000,
      1063176
     ],
     "lineH": 243840,
     "ins": 0
    },
    {
     "id": "15",
     "kind": "text",
     "chars": 108,
     "max": 108,
     "perLine": 27,
     "lines": 4,
     "caps": false,
     "sz": 18,
     "paras": 3,
     "text": "Qo'sh gumbaz — balandlik va mustahkamlik\nQovurg'ali gumbaz — Go'ri Amirda\nSirti moviy koshin bilan qoplanadi",
     "font": "Georgia",
     "anchor": "t",
     "box": [
